@host = http://localhost:5007
@adminHost = http://localhost:8087

### Diagnóstico de entorno
GET {{host}}/api/status

### Diagnóstico de Kestrel (solo puerto administrativo)
GET {{adminHost}}/api/kestrel-info

### Listar usuarios
GET {{host}}/api/usuarios

### Listar formatos
GET {{host}}/api/formatos

### Listar perfumes
GET {{host}}/api/perfumes

### Listar perfumes filtrados por formato (1 = Tubo)
GET {{host}}/api/perfumes?formatoId=1

### Crear perfume
POST {{host}}/api/perfumes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Sauvage",
  "marca": "Dior",
  "precio": 85000,
  "usuarioId": 1,
  "formatoId": 1
}

### Actualizar perfume
PUT {{host}}/api/perfumes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Sauvage Elixir",
  "marca": "Dior",
  "precio": 99000,
  "usuarioId": 1,
  "formatoId": 1
}

### Eliminar perfume
DELETE {{host}}/api/perfumes/1
